        {
          "body": "[P1] Count only grader packets actually submitted\n\n`close_preassessment` filters source packets whose `model_call_required` is false, so those packets are not sent and have no submission receipt. Counting every `prepared_refs.preassessment_packets` item here nevertheless adds those unsent bytes to grader request totals and maxima, overstating resource usage whenever an unassessable source packet is present.",
          "commit_id": "90ff83f6559786307478ff3e117d3197cfbd9155",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T19:56:00Z",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/pull/742#discussion_r4234035742",
